                                                "sense_id": "ce7b6d24-cf31-313d-914f-bb10e3abeb1a",
                                                "text": "On most of the heavy ratinés the yarn sizes are relatively 4-1 or coarser, while in many of these rice cloths the relative yarn sizes are 7–1 or finer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
